@@ -0,0 +1,17 @@
+# Retained Vivaldi visual reference
+
+Vivaldi remains installed and runnable, outside the seven primary browser roles.
+Floorp remains the preferred power-user browser. Retain existing rendering,
+managed policies, extensions, settings, Mail/Calendar/Feeds, OAuth, unsent/local
+data, credentials and imported bookmarks. Later retirement requires explicit
+operator approval and a separately reviewed source release. No feeds-only
+transition or new profile writer is selected.
+
+Future qualification is separate: catalogue only operator-selected Vivaldi UI
+effects during attended observation; distinguish Gecko browser chrome
+(`userChrome.css`) from page content (`userContent.css`); test a faithful recreation
+in a disposable Floorp profile first. Confirm supported mechanisms and each
+browser version's behavior without assuming parity. Study another Gecko role
+only after an explicit operator preference. This source phase includes no
+Vivaldi source copying, CSS extraction, screenshots, private-profile inspection,
+GUI automation, TCC access or profile mutation.
